A||||27||Terrybogin||A new ricer/Fiero song||||1||
Z||000000||Terrybogin||07-18-2001||12:32 AM||||If the ricer term offends you, get out. For everyone else, enjoy! The tune is, of course, The Devil Went Down to Georgia.<P>The Ricer went Down to Georgia.<P>The ricer went down to Georgia, he was looking for some clothes to steal,<BR>He was in a bind and showing his behind and he was willing to make a deal.<BR>When he came upon a young man working on a Fiero and revvin’ it hard,<BR>the ricer jumped up on his 3 level wing and said “Boy let me tell you what.<BR>I bet you didn’t know it, but I’m a street racing fool, and if you care to take a dare, I’ll make a bet with you. <BR>Now, you drive a pretty hot Fiero, boy, but give a ricer his duel. I’ll bet my wheels of gold against your clothes ‘cause I think I’m faster than you.”<BR>The boy said “My name’s Johnny, and that wing you’ve got’s a sin. But I’ll take your bet and you’re gonna regret, ‘cause I’m the quickest there’s every been.”<P>Johnny rev up your Duke and pop that clutch real hard, ‘cause rice has broke loose in Georgia and Uncle Ben deals the cards. And if you win you get those shiny wheels of plated gold, but if you loose the ricer gets your clothes.<P>The ricer jumped from his wing and said “I’ll start this show” and fire flew from the pain in his eyes as that wing hit his elbow. <BR>He revved his engine and that timing belt made an awful hiss and the coffee can joined right in and it sounded a lot like $hit.<P>When the ricer finished, Johnny said “That’s really sad there son, but meet me at the starting line and let my show you how it’s done.”<P>Johnny rev up your Duke and pop that clutch real hard, ‘cause rice has broke loose in Georgia and Uncle Ben deals the cards. And if you win you get those shiny wheels of plated gold, but if you loose the ricer gets your clothes.<P>When the smoke had cleared, the race was done, the ricer knew that he’d been beat. <BR>So his homies laid those plated wheels on the ground at Johnny’s feet.<BR>Johnny said, “Now ricer come on back if you ever want to try again-<BR>‘cause I told you once, you son of a gun, I’m the quickest there’s ever been.”<BR>||||reg||1
